{"ticker":"GOOGL","updated":"2026-10-30T22:51:08Z","profile":{"longName":"Alphabet Inc.","shortName":"Alphabet Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"United States","website":"https://abc.xyz","fullTimeEmployees":204757,"marketCap":3440352690176,"trailingPE":14.613055,"forwardPE":18.485123,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.302839,"pegRatio":1.0,"targetMeanPrice":408.08655,"targetHighPrice":500.0,"targetLowPrice":325.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":52,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.247,"earningsGrowth":-0.26,"grossMargins":0.60857,"operatingMargins":0.31805,"profitMargins":0.50031,"totalRevenue":471097999360,"beta":1.211,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":408.61,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":270.7,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.31},"summary":"Alphabet Inc. offers various products and platforms in the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia-Pacific, Canada, and Latin America. It operates through Google Services, Google Cloud, and Other Bets segments. The Google Services segment provides products and services, including ads, Android, Chrome, devices, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube. It is also involved in the sale of apps and in-app purchases and digital content in Google Play and YouTube; and devices, as well as the provision of YouTube consumer subscription services, such as YouTube TV, YouTube Music and Premium, NFL Sunday Ticket, and Google One. The Google Cloud segment offers consumption-based fees and subscriptions for AI solutions, including AI infrastructure, Vertex AI platform, and Gemini enterprise. It also provides cybersecurity, and data and analytics services; Google Workspace that include cloud-based communication and collaboration tools for enterprises, such as Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Drive, and Meet; and other enterprise services. The Other Bets segment sells transportation and internet services. Alphabet Inc. was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Mountain View, California.","summary_zh":"Alphabet Inc. 在美國、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區、加拿大和拉丁美洲提供各種產品和平台。它透過谷歌服務、谷歌雲端和其他賭注部門運作。 Google 服務部門提供產品和服務，包括廣告、Android、Chrome、裝置、Gmail、Google 雲端硬碟、Google 地圖、Google 照片、Google Play、搜尋和 YouTube。它還參與 Google Play 和 YouTube 中應用程式的銷售和應用程式內購買以及數位內容；和設備，以及提供 YouTube 消費者訂閱服務，例如 YouTube TV、YouTube Music 和 Premium、NFL Sunday Ticket 和 Google One。 Google Cloud 部門為 AI 解決方案提供以消費為基礎的費用和訂閱，包括 AI 基礎架構、Vertex AI 平台和 Gemini 企業。它還提供網路安全、資料和分析服務； Google Workspace，包括以企業為基礎的雲端的通訊和協作工具，例如日曆、Gmail、Docs、Drive 和 Meet；及其他企業服務。其他投注部門銷售運輸和網路服務。 Alphabet Inc. 成立於 1998 年，總部位於加州山景城。","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"網路內容與資訊","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":208.44,"h":211.68,"l":206.2,"c":211.35,"v":47523000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":226.21,"h":231.31,"l":224.79,"c":230.66,"v":103336100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":229.65,"h":232.37,"l":226.11,"c":232.3,"v":51684200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":232.2,"h":235.76,"l":231.9,"c":235.0,"v":46588900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":235.47,"h":238.13,"l":233.67,"c":234.04,"v":32474700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":234.17,"h":240.47,"l":233.23,"c":239.63,"v":38061000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":238.9,"h":241.66,"l":237.85,"c":239.17,"v":35141100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":239.88,"h":242.25,"l":236.25,"c":240.37,"v":30599300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":240.37,"h":242.08,"l":238.0,"c":240.8,"v":26771600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":244.66,"h":252.41,"l":244.66,"c":251.61,"v":58383800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":252.08,"h":253.04,"l":249.47,"c":251.16,"v":34109700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":251.22,"h":251.6,"l":246.28,"c":249.53,"v":34108000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":251.68,"h":253.99,"l":249.8,"c":252.03,"v":31239500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":253.25,"h":256.0,"l":251.81,"c":254.72,"v":55571400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":254.43,"h":255.78,"l":250.3,"c":252.53,"v":32290500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":253.04,"h":254.36,"l":250.48,"c":251.66,"v":26628000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":251.66,"h":252.35,"l":246.44,"c":247.14,"v":28201000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":244.